          "alphanumeral": "",
          "iconTheme": "primary-brand",
          "theme": "transparent",
          "link": {},
          "image": {},
          "body": "\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>To submit a grant request, the completed Allianz Corporate Giving Application must be submitted via email by 11:59 p.m. on the deadline. Incomplete applications will not be accepted. An organization may only receive funding in only one of the focus areas each year.</p>\n<p>Applications are available to\u00a0<a href=\"/allianz-assets/f0987c9285cd8d99-allianz-grant-application-2026.docx\">download here (docx)</a>.</p>\n<p>If you have any questions, please <a href=\"mailto:communityengagement@allianzlife.com\">send us an email</a>.</p>\n\t\t\t\t",
