          "card": {
            "heading": "Financial stability",
            "headingLevel": "h3",
            "subheading": "",
            "body": "\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tileBody u-font-size-xl\">\n<p>Application due March 2, 2026</p>\n</div>\n<p>We understand that to be included in economic life, people need to meet their basic needs first. Allianz supports organizations that work to meet these needs, with a focus on creating stability and financial independence.</p>\n<p>We provide grants to organizations that:</p>\n<ul>\n    <li>Provide food, clothing, shelter, and/or programming\u00a0that supports individuals and families in increasing their financial stability (for example, food banks and transitional housing programs).</li>\n</ul>\n\t\t\t\t",
            "alphanumeral": "",
            "iconTheme": "transparent",
            "theme": "transparent",
            "link": {},
            "icon": {},
            "image": {
              "src": "https://thlt-demo.sitecoresandbox.cloud/api/public/content/95191ee4f135401086be1e55cdbd91d6?v=e631ba01",
